Domino’s Pizza’s first quarter fell short of analysts’ expectations, with U.S. same-store sales growth of 0.9% and global retail sales growth of 3.4%.&nbsp;

On the international side, same-store sales declined 0.4%. The fast-food pizza chain opened 180 net new units in Q1, including 19 in the U.S. and 161 internationally.&nbsp;

